    "turn_text": "Tonight, Mr. Trump will rally in Allentown, Pennsylvania. That's an area with a sizable Latino and Puerto Rican population just two days after a comedian made racist and crude jokes about Latinos and the island of Puerto Rico at Mr. Trump's rally in New York City. Campaign sources tell NBC News that tonight's program at Trump's event will lean heavily on Puerto Rican speakers. But Sunday's comments appear to have wrangled voters beyond the Latino community, including a key group of voters that both Trump and Harris campaigns are trying to reach. People who voted for Nikki Haley in their Republican primary. Last night, as part of our NBC News Deciders focus group, we went back to some Nikki Haley voters who are now split on whether they're voting for Trump or Harris or neither. But some who had strong reactions to those racist comments at the Trump rally.",
