      {
        "text": "The Trump campaign did not refer to the event as a press conference.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "A press conference traditionally involves taking questions from reporters.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Donald Trump did not take any questions during the event.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has personally advocated against labeling the event a press conference at their network.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The Trump campaign did not indicate that Donald Trump would take questions during the event.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Remarks to press and press conference have distinct meanings according to the speaker.",
