    "turn_text": "Yeah, again, a lot of back and forth on this subject. We're waiting to see if there are protests here tonight. And the big question is whether or not the former president addresses those remarks here at the rally. And if there is any kind of apology, a lot of people holding their breath to see what happens here tonight.",
